{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_NO_FASTCALL__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_NO_FASTCALL__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when ##-z no-fastcall## instructs the compiler to ignore ##__fastcall## directives, or zero (0) otherwise.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptz|Compiler Option: -z]]
	- ##[[KeyPgFastcall|__fastcall]]##

